{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/c900a743c72865953469d22dde625e04.poster.avif?t=1755174165\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/c900a743c72865953469d22dde625e04.webm?t=1755174165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/c900a743c72865953469d22dde625e04.mp4?t=1755174165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in the ultimate test to become the world\u2019s greatest robot pilot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conducted in a fully virtual reality environment, this test will push your dexterity, composure, and spatial awareness to the absolute limit. Of course, you're free to quit at any time... <strong>unless an unexpected glitch traps you inside the simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Control Machine</strong> is a 3D platformer where you play using 30 completely different controllers. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the control scheme changes periodically. Here are just a few examples:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Standard WASD movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turning with right/left click and moving forward with the mouse wheel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stepping forward with Q for your left foot and P for your right foot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pressing an on-screen virtual keyboard using your mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Controlling a virtual player on a virtual screen with a virtual-virtual keyboard to make that player step on another keyboard and move your actual character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a brutally challenging platformer where a single mistake can send you all the way back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your limits!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896750?t=1755174165","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896750?t=1755174165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/fb6053f95625ac7172fa5f4c6f42452d4dbb7a33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755174165","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/fb6053f95625ac7172fa5f4c6f42452d4dbb7a33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755174165","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/c900a743c72865953469d22dde625e04.poster.avif?t=1755174165\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/c900a743c72865953469d22dde625e04.webm?t=1755174165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/c900a743c72865953469d22dde625e04.mp4?t=1755174165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in the ultimate test to become the world\u2019s greatest robot pilot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conducted in a fully virtual reality environment, this test will push your dexterity, composure, and spatial awareness to the absolute limit. Of course, you're free to quit at any time... <strong>unless an unexpected glitch traps you inside the simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Control Machine</strong> is a 3D platformer where you play using 30 completely different controllers. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the control scheme changes periodically. Here are just a few examples:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Standard WASD movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turning with right/left click and moving forward with the mouse wheel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stepping forward with Q for your left foot and P for your right foot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pressing an on-screen virtual keyboard using your mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Controlling a virtual player on a virtual screen with a virtual-virtual keyboard to make that player step on another keyboard and move your actual character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a brutally challenging platformer where a single mistake can send you all the way back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your limits!</p>","developers":["Studio LEF"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/469d02c45822d1ec02cee107a86dbf348fe9454c/header.jpg?t=1755174165","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Ultimate Control Machine","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</st